# cascade-after-the-pivot

Alice's meme has a stranger's thread under it and two strangers' pointers at it and into it. 
Erasing it starts a cascade AFTER the pivot — and the cascade's two hops are keyed by the 
meme while the saga is keyed by the leaver, so nothing orders them against each other. The 
specs deliver that cascade on a step of their own, always last; this asks about every other 
placement. 

